 out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="what-to-sell-on-etsy" class="section-wrapper" index="10" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="section__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>What to sell on Etsy</h2><div class="section__description" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Etsy is great for UK sellers to sell handmade crafts, vintage items, and unique products. Whether it&#39;s handmade jewellery, custom art, or vintage clothes, Etsy connects sellers with customers worldwide. You can reach international markets easily through Etsy&#39;s shipping options and local browsing experiences. It&#39;s the perfect place to expand beyond local sales and connect with customers who love artisanal and one-of-a-kind items from around the world.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--[--><div data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--multi" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tkQZbqstJ9-fBH_EVRI_LOCATION_05_73458a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tkQZbqstJ9-fBH_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7345.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tkQZbqstJ9-fBH_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7345.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tkQZbqstJ9-fBH_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7345.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A mother and her two children open up a parcel. They are sat cuddled up on a sofa in their living room." width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><h3 class="card__title" data-v-e1e30b9c>Things to sell on Etsy</h3><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Here are some examples of what sells best on Etsy in 2025:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Handmade jewellery<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Art prints<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Candles<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Vintage clothing and accessories<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Craft supplies<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Wedding invitations and decorations<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Personalised gifts like notebooks, engraved cutting boards, and custom illustrations<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-h