Find top-selling tips for UK sellers and start selling on Etsy today.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-sell-on-etsy",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":16,"slug":17,"first_publication_date":18,"last_publication_date":18,"uid":17,"link_type":19,"key":20,"isBroken":21},"ZL-1EREAACAAEkhR","subpath1",[15],"Guides","en-gb","guides","2023-07-25T12:59:36+0000","Document","ae1cdca3-7951-4e98-bb07-7c8775dcd737",false,{"link_type":19},[24,43,73,140,244,275,335,380,428,441,466,509,536,558],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":29,"id":41,"slice_type":42,"slice_label":30},"pageHeaderNoCta","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[28],{},{"theme":30,"PageHeaderTitle":31,"PageHeaderText":32,"PageHeaderImage":38,"heroImage":39,"videoContent":40,"showPremiumLogo":30},null,"How to sell on Etsy",[33],{"type":34,"text":35,"spans":36,"direction":37},"paragraph","A simple guide on how to start selling on Etsy",[],"ltr",{},{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":45,"primary":47,"id":71,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},"default-slice",[46],{},{"CardImage":48,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":61,"CardText":62,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":69,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":49,"alt":52,"copyright":30,"url":53,"id":54,"edit":55},{"width":50,"height":51},1000,665,"A customer is crouched on the floor of their apartment, holding items in one hand and is about to place them in the box in front of them.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XrypbqstJ9-WeK_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5211.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6XrypbqstJ9-WeK",{"x":56,"y":57,"zoom":58,"background":59},0,8,1,"transparent","none","A guide to selling on Etsy",[63,66],{"type":34,"text":64,"spans":65,"direction":37},"Learn how to start your Etsy shop from your laptop with ease using our complete guide. Discover setup costs, top-selling items, and essential tips to maximise your sales. We'll show you how to handle shipping and choose the right carrier for delivering orders to your Etsy customers. Whether you're new to selling or looking to expand your online store, our latest* guide provides all the tools you need to succeed on Etsy.",[],{"type":34,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":37},"*Content for this guide is accurate as of March 2025.",[],{"link_type":70},"Any","card$190bc9f4-7c73-4e91-ae59-d827179c3e89","card",{"variation":74,"version":26,"items":75,"primary":134,"id":138,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":30},"listNoIcon",[76,80,86,92,98,104,110,116,122,128],{"title":77,"content":78,"isNumbered":79},"Login or create an Etsy account",[],true,{"title":81,"content":82,"isNumbered":79},"Set your profile and preferences",[83],{"type":34,"text":84,"spans":85,"direction":37},"Go to your profile and select ‘Sell on Etsy’ in the top menu of your web page.",[],{"title":87,"content":88,"isNumbered":79},"Open your Etsy shop",[89],{"type":34,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":37},"Click ‘Open your Etsy shop’ and confirm with ‘Let’s do this’",[],{"title":93,"content":94,"isNumbered":79},"Complete a short survey",[95],{"type":34,"text":96,"spans":97,"direction":37},"Etsy will provide a short survey to understand your needs and share more relevant resources based on your answers. This stage is optional, so you can choose to complete or skip to move on to the next part of the setup.",[],{"title":99,"content":100,"isNumbered":79},"Set shop preferences",[101],{"type":34,"text":102,"spans":103,"direction":37},"Now it’s time to choose your shop preferences, including language, country and currency.",[],{"title":105,"content":106,"isNumbered":79},"Name your shop",[107],{"type":34,"text":108,"spans":109,"direction":37},"Don’t worry - you’ll be able to edit this later if you change your mind.",[],{"title":111,"content":112,"isNumbered":79},"Share some details about your product",[113],{"type":34,"text":114,"spans":115,"direction":37},"Etsy needs to know information like what category your item comes under, what type of item it is, when it was made, and who by.",[],{"title":117,"content":118,"isNumbered":79},"Add more details about your listing",[119],{"type":34,"text":120,"spans":121,"direction":37},"This is information your customers can see in your shop. You’ll need to provide a product title and description, share photos and a price. Etsy features plenty of useful fields to help you give as much detail as you can, including colour, material, and keyword tags for customers to find your product.",[],{"title":123,"content":124,"isNumbered":79},"Select your delivery preferences",[125],{"type":34,"text":126,"spans":127,"direction":37},"Make sure to check out our section below for guidance on choosing a delivery provider and how to change your preference.",[],{"title":129,"content":130,"isNumbered":79},"Ready to upload?",[131],{"type":34,"text":132,"spans":133,"direction":37},"If you’re ready to list straight away, select ‘Preview’ to make sure you’re happy before confirming your listing. Click ‘save and continue’ to move on to the next steps for adding your bank details.",[],{"theme":135,"title":136,"description":137,"showPaddingTop":21},"standard","How to set up an Etsy shop","We’ve made setting up an Etsy shop easy! Follow our step-by-step instructions using your desktop browser to get you started.","list_block$94ea643d-7494-4a1e-986a-9ed25b57f891","list_block",{"variation":141,"version":26,"items":142,"primary":240,"id":243,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":30},"listComponent",[143,156,168,180,192,204,216,228],{"title":144,"content":145,"icon":149},"Great photos",[146],{"type":34,"text":147,"spans":148,"direction":37},"Capture your products in natural light and from various angles to highlight their uniqueness. Quality visuals on Etsy catch shoppers' eyes faster.",[],{"dimensions":150,"alt":152,"copyright":30,"url":153,"id":154,"edit":155},{"width":151,"height":151},40,"Camera icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9ecd696f-d8c8-4a09-bdab-f2ed97d94895_cameras.svg","Yh96GBIAACkA-Zso",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":157,"content":158,"icon":162},"Detailed descriptions",[159],{"type":34,"text":160,"spans":161,"direction":37},"Detail each item's story, materials used, and how it's made. Honest, informative descriptions help build trust with Etsy buyers.",[],{"dimensions":163,"alt":164,"copyright":30,"url":165,"id":166,"edit":167},{"width":151,"height":151},"Followed instructions icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg","YflB_BEAACIA8pcK",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":169,"content":170,"icon":174},"Diversify your offerings",[171],{"type":34,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":37},"Expand your product range to cater to different tastes and occasions. Etsy shoppers love discovering unique finds for every season and celebration.",[],{"dimensions":175,"alt":176,"copyright":30,"url":177,"id":178,"edit":179},{"width":151,"height":151},"Clothes in a box icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F310e5f30-345e-45c1-a5cb-91a5eceee8ae_What%27s+in+the+box.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsT",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":181,"content":182,"icon":186},"Master Etsy SEO",[183],{"type":34,"text":184,"spans":185,"direction":37},"Add relevant keywords throughout your titles, descriptions, and tags. This helps potential customers discover your listings more easily than the competition.",[],{"dimensions":187,"alt":188,"copyright":30,"url":189,"id":190,"edit":191},{"width":151,"height":151},"Lightbulb icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9028d913-9c89-4f01-b423-3fd1d160c4a1_lightbulb.svg?auto=compress,format","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zru",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":193,"content":194,"icon":198},"Shipping solutions",[195],{"type":34,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":37},"Offer free shipping if you can to attract more buyers and provide clear details on tracking and your returns policy. This reassures buyers and boosts their confidence.",[],{"dimensions":199,"alt":200,"copyright":30,"url":201,"id":202,"edit":203},{"width":151,"height":151},"Courier icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41cd86aa-f6de-4624-bc9c-90ec921f0ed2_courier2.svg","Yh96FRIAACwA-Zrk",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":205,"content":206,"icon":210},"Good customer service",[207],{"type":34,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":37},"Stay responsive and friendly in all your communications. Positive customer service can turn first-time buyers into loyal fans.",[],{"dimensions":211,"alt":212,"copyright":30,"url":213,"id":214,"edit":215},{"width":151,"height":151},"Friendly icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9fb9d950-2c3e-4a43-a975-c773dd47adf3_friendly.svg","YflB_BEAACEA8pcM",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":217,"content":218,"icon":222},"Run promotions",[219],{"type":34,"text":220,"spans":221,"direction":37},"Plan occasional sales or special offers to attract attention and reward your Etsy community.",[],{"dimensions":223,"alt":224,"copyright":30,"url":225,"id":226,"edit":227},{"width":151,"height":151},"Pricing icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d6596ea-88df-43fd-b67a-22e944657aa2_pricing.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zrx",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"title":229,"content":230,"icon":234},"Keep listings fresh",[231],{"type":34,"text":232,"spans":233,"direction":37},"Regularly update your shop with new items and refresh existing listings. This keeps your Etsy storefront dynamic and engaging.",[],{"dimensions":235,"alt":236,"copyright":30,"url":237,"id":238,"edit":239},{"width":151,"height":151},"Calender icon","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd07cc46f-b0cc-4157-a458-56979ba382e7_calendar.svg","Yh96FxIAAC4A-Zsf",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},{"theme":135,"title":241,"description":242},"Tips for selling on Etsy","Increase your chances of success with our recommended tips for selling on Etsy:","list_block$72f570c0-0760-4a76-9b25-748abb0fffd3",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":245,"primary":247,"id":274,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},[246],{},{"CardImage":248,"CardAvatar":60,"CardTitle":255,"CardText":256,"ButtonText":30,"ButtonUrl":273,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":249,"alt":251,"copyright":30,"url":252,"id":253,"edit":254},{"width":50,"height":250},667,"A female courier dressed in an Evri uniform stands in front of a blue Evri van. She is posing with a parcel in her hands.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y_05bqstJ9-iMl_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9407.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6y_05bqstJ9-iMl",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},"Choosing your delivery provider",[257,260],{"type":34,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":37},"Choosing the right delivery service is key to making sure your Etsy customers have a smooth experience, which can improve your seller reputation. Fast and reliable delivery builds trust and encourages repeat business. With Evri, you'll receive outstanding courier services for a lower price, helping you maintain high service standards and grow your Etsy business.",[],{"type":34,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":37},"See what puts us among the best courier services in the UK for your business.",[263,271],{"start":264,"end":265,"type":266,"data":267},27,58,"hyperlink",{"link_type":268,"url":269,"target":270},"Web","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbest-courier-services-in-the-uk","_blank",{"start":264,"end":265,"type":272},"strong",{"link_type":70},"card$7c607924-49de-4591-9f71-2fda538cb481",{"variation":74,"version":26,"items":276,"primary":331,"id":334,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":30},[277,289,313,319,325],{"title":278,"content":279,"isNumbered":79},"Package your items",[280],{"type":34,"text":281,"spans":282,"direction":37},"Package and prepare your parcel ready for sending to your customer. See our guide on how to package your parcel for more information.",[283,288],{"start":284,"end":285,"type":266,"data":286},85,111,{"link_type":268,"url":287,"target":270},"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-wrap-a-parcel",{"start":284,"end":285,"type":272},{"title":290,"content":291,"isNumbered":79},"Buy your label",[292],{"type":34,"text":293,"spans":294,"direction":37},"Go to Evri.com to purchase your label. Check out our guides on how to send a parcel and how to label a parcel to find out more.",[295,300,301,306,307,312],{"start":296,"end":297,"type":266,"data":298},6,14,{"link_type":268,"url":299,"target":270},"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fevri.com",{"start":296,"end":297,"type":272},{"start":302,"end":303,"type":266,"data":304},63,83,{"link_type":268,"url":305,"target":270},"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fhow-to-send-a-parcel",{"start":302,"end":303,"type":272},{"start":308,"end":309,"type":266,"data":310},88,109,{"link_type":268,"url":311,"target":270},"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-label-a-parcel",{"start":308,"end":309,"type":272},{"title":314,"content":315,"isNumbered":79},"Send your parcel",[316],{"type":34,"text":317,"spans":318,"direction":37},"Drop off your parcel or arrange a collection",[],{"title":320,"content":321,"isNumbered":79},"Update your order",[322],{"type":34,"text":323,"spans":324,"direction":37},"Log into your Etsy account and go to Shop Manager. Choose ‘Orders & Delivery’ to update your orders in the ‘Open’ tab. Select the timer icon on the right side of the order you dispatched and choose ‘Complete order’.",[],{"title":326,"content":327,"isNumbered":79},"Complete your order",[328],{"type":34,"text":329,"spans":330,"direction":37},"Once you complete an order, it will move to the ‘Completed’ tab. When you select ‘Complete order’, you'll have the option to set the order’s ‘Dispatch Date’ and add an optional ‘Note to Buyer’, as well as a tracking number and delivery provider for the package. Etsy will then notify your buyer that their item has been dispatched and they can track their item.",[],{"theme":135,"title":332,"description":333,"showPaddingTop":21},"Shipping orders for Etsy","After a customer has purchased an item, Etsy gives sellers different options to buy a shipping label and send their parcel. We recommend visiting Evri.com for the latest deals on our services. Follow these simple steps below to buy your label with us:","list_block$4e29f227-6c24-4232-aea6-dddbc546a74c",{"variation":74,"version":26,"items":336,"primary":376,"id":379,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":30},[337,340,346,352,358,370],{"title":338,"content":339,"isNumbered":79},"Log into your Etsy account",[],{"title":341,"content":342,"isNumbered":79},"Delivery settings",[343],{"type":34,"text":344,"spans":345,"direction":37},"Go to your delivery settings, select ‘profile’ and ‘create new’. Fill in the fields about your postcode and the time needed to process your order.",[],{"title":347,"content":348,"isNumbered":79},"Choose your delivery service for UK customers",[349],{"type":34,"text":350,"spans":351,"direction":37},"With Evri, you can select Standard or Next Day delivery and choose whether to arrange a Courier collection from your door or drop off at 10,000 locations near you.",[],{"title":353,"content":354,"isNumbered":79},"Set your delivery price",[355],{"type":34,"text":356,"spans":357,"direction":37},"We’d recommend adding the cost to your listing and advertising your item as ‘free delivery’ to increase appeal.",[],{"title":359,"content":360,"isNumbered":79},"Consider international options",[361],{"type":34,"text":362,"spans":363,"direction":37},"You can also choose your delivery service for ‘everywhere else’. This is optional and will help you to expand your audience to international customers when you’re ready to. Did you know we deliver to 200+ countries and territories worldwide from only £6.08?",[364,369],{"start":365,"end":366,"type":266,"data":367},186,240,{"link_type":268,"url":368,"target":270},"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"start":365,"end":366,"type":272},{"title":371,"content":372,"isNumbered":79},"Save your delivery profile",[373],{"type":34,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":37},"Click ‘Apply’ to confirm your changes.",[],{"theme":135,"title":377,"description":378,"showPaddingTop":21},"How to change your Etsy delivery preference to Evri","Setting up your delivery profiles and clearly defining your order processing schedule means your customers can know exactly what to expect for your delivery times and prices. Delivery profiles can save you time for listings with similar postage costs when you add new items or update existing ones in your Etsy shop. Here’s how to create a new delivery profile:","list_block$3a2c7eaf-e1f3-4d5b-91b2-e6332a4febf6",{"variation":381,"version":26,"items":382,"primary":422,"id":427,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},"multiContentCard",[383],{"CardImage":384,"CardTitle":390,"CardText":391},{"dimensions":385,"alt":386,"copyright":30,"url":387,"id":388,"edit":389},{"width":50,"height":250},"A side-view profile of a customer sitting on a sofa, with a laptop resting on their lap as they look down at the screen.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5681.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xqi5bqstJ9-WcS",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},"How to create a new delivery profile:",[392,395,398,401,404,406,409,412,417,419],{"type":393,"text":338,"spans":394,"direction":37},"o-list-item",[],{"type":393,"text":396,"spans":397,"direction":37},"Go to your Delivery settings",[],{"type":393,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":37},"Select ‘profile’ and ‘Create new’",[],{"type":393,"text":402,"spans":403,"direction":37},"Fill in the fields about your postcode and time needed to process your order",[],{"type":393,"text":347,"spans":405,"direction":37},[],{"type":393,"text":407,"spans":408,"direction":37},"With Evri, you can select Standard or Next Day delivery and choose whether to arrange a Courier collection from your door or drop off at 10,000 locations near you",[],{"type":393,"text":410,"spans":411,"direction":37},"Set your delivery price - we’d recommend adding the cost to your listing and advertising your item as ‘free delivery’ to increase appeal",[],{"type":393,"text":362,"spans":413,"direction":37},[414,416],{"start":365,"end":366,"type":266,"data":415},{"link_type":268,"url":368,"target":270},{"start":365,"end":366,"type":272},{"type":393,"text":371,"spans":418,"direction":37},[],{"type":393,"text":420,"spans":421,"direction":37},"Click ‘Apply’ to confirm your changes",[],{"CardSectionTitle":377,"CardSectionText":423},[424],{"type":34,"text":425,"spans":426,"direction":37},"Setting up your delivery profiles and clearly defining your order processing schedule means your customers can know exactly what to expect for your delivery times and prices. Delivery profiles can save you time for listings with similar postage costs when you add new items or update existing ones in your Etsy shop.",[],"card$772915eb-e3a3-40ba-a8ae-620c86e76cf7",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":429,"primary":430,"id":439,"slice_type":440,"slice_label":30},[],{"heading":431,"description":432,"image":433},"TRUSTED by our customers","Each year, we deliver over 800 million parcels, earning the trust of renowned brands such as Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Wayfair, and Next. Evri boasts more 5-star ratings on Trustpilot than any other UK carrier, reflecting our commitment to exceptional service. See what our customers have to say or explore our Trustpilot reviews for firsthand experiences.",{"dimensions":434,"alt":435,"copyright":30,"url":436,"id":437,"edit":438},{"width":50,"height":250},"A family of four pose smiling in front of their front door holding two parcels. The family consists of a father, mother and two daughters.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},"trust_pilot$b838a6de-0b80-4df9-b542-9a105dc36909","trust_pilot",{"variation":442,"version":26,"items":443,"primary":444,"id":465,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},"cardWithinSection",[],{"CardSectionTitle":445,"CardSectionText":446,"CardImage":450,"CardTitle":456,"CardText":457,"ButtonText":461,"ButtonUrl":462,"IsEco":21},"",[447],{"type":34,"text":448,"spans":449,"direction":37}," ",[],{"dimensions":451,"alt":452,"copyright":30,"url":453,"id":454,"edit":455},{"width":50,"height":250},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},"Etsy integrations",[458],{"type":34,"text":459,"spans":460,"direction":37},"Once you’ve become confident as an Etsy seller, why not check out our easy tool to make sending Etsy parcels even faster? You can book multiple orders at once when you connect your Etsy account with Evri. Simply import your customer orders in one go and set your parcel defaults to make sending even faster in future. Plus, you can also integrate with other e-commerce and marketplaces in one place.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":268,"key":463,"url":464},"c4f19891-2cea-4435-80ed-b0e8d660b0e3","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fetsy-integration","card$1ed0a1b9-7963-49bd-83ac-69e3da4f26a8",{"variation":381,"version":26,"items":467,"primary":502,"id":508,"slice_type":72,"slice_label":30},[468],{"CardImage":469,"CardTitle":475,"CardText":476},{"dimensions":470,"alt":471,"copyright":30,"url":472,"id":473,"edit":474},{"width":50,"height":250},"A mother and her two children open up a parcel. They are sat cuddled up on a sofa in their living room.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tkQZbqstJ9-fBH_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7345.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6tkQZbqstJ9-fBH",{"x":56,"y":56,"zoom":58,"background":59},"Things to sell on Etsy",[477,480,484,487,490,493,496,499],{"type":34,"text":478,"spans":479,"direction":37},"Here are some examples of what sells best on Etsy in 2025:",[],{"type":481,"text":482,"spans":483,"direction":37},"list-item","Handmade jewellery",[],{"type":481,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":37},"Art prints",[],{"type":481,"text":488,"spans":489,"direction":37},"Candles",[],{"type":481,"text":491,"spans":492,"direction":37},"Vintage clothing and accessories",[],{"type":481,"text":494,"spans":495,"direction":37},"Craft supplies",[],{"type":481,"text":497,"spans":498,"direction":37},"Wedding invitations and decorations",[],{"type":481,"text":500,"spans":501,"direction":37},"Personalised gifts like notebooks, engraved cutting boards, and custom illustrations",[],{"CardSectionTitle":503,"CardSectionText":504},"What to sell on Etsy",[505],{"type":34,"text":506,"spans":507,"direction":37},"Etsy is great for UK sellers to sell handmade crafts, vintage items, and unique products. Whether it's handmade jewellery, custom art, or vintage clothes, Etsy connects sellers with customers worldwide. You can reach international markets easily through Etsy's shipping options and local browsing experiences. It's the perfect place to expand beyond local sales and connect with customers who love artisanal and one-of-a-kind items from around the world.",[],"card$f54a8a9c-b17c-4446-a3dd-298bfdd8abcd",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":510,"primary":511,"id":534,"slice_type":535,"slice_label":30},[],{"Image":512},{"dimensions":513,"alt":516,"copyright":30,"url":517,"id":518,"edit":519,"tablet":521,"mobile":527},{"width":514,"height":515},1200,280,"A mother is folding a pair of jeans on a coffee table, preparing them to be packaged and sent with Evri. Her two children are sat talking to eachother on the sofa behind her.","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tflZbqstJ9-e4m_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7525.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C3225%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6tflZbqstJ9-e4m",{"x":56,"y":520,"zoom":58,"background":59},3225,{"dimensions":522,"alt":516,"copyright":30,"url":524,"id":518,"edit":525},{"width":523,"height":366},704,"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tflZbqstJ9-e4m_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7525.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2671%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":56,"y":526,"zoom":58,"background":59},2671,{"dimensions":528,"alt":516,"copyright":30,"url":531,"id":518,"edit":532},{"width":529,"height":530},343,160,"how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6tflZbqstJ9-e4m_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7525.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C905%2C8192%2C3821&w=343&h=160",{"x":56,"y":533,"zoom":58,"background":59},905,"photo_block$2983edd2-20c2-4a61-9b32-3d3b93fad489","photo_block",{"variation":44,"version":26,"items":537,"primary":553,"id":556,"slice_type":557,"slice_label":30},[538,543,548],{"title":539,"content":30,"pillEnabled":21,"link":540,"dataGtmTrack":30},"How to package clothes for shipping",{"link_type":268,"key":541,"url":542},"c8a61468-6c8d-4eaf-ba89-cfcc1e112758","how-to-sell-on-etsy.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-package-clothes-for-shipping",{"title":544,"content":30,"pillEnabled":21,"link":545,"dataGt